ur students and teachers. E-learning studioCamTech is ready to adapt to the unpredictable changes dictated from the \u201cnew normal\u201d that we have to be ready to face. Laboratory, workshop, computer and internet access&#8230; Read more about CamTech facilities&#8230; Our Motto KRC Knowledge Reason Character Our Values Core Values Integrity Respect Excellence Innovation Diversity Hard Skills Math Science Language Arts Social Science Well-Being Physical Cognitive Mental Emotional Social &amp; Spiritual Soft Skills Critical Thinking Creativity Collaboration Communication CamTech has its own brand new campus with stunning rooms for onsite lessons and the most modern e-learning technology. Our students will access many facilities which include football and tennis fields, swimming pool, digital and non-digital library, merchandising and stationery shop and canteen, just to name few. The building is located in an area of five hectares in Sangkat Praek Ta Sek, Satellite city, Khan Chroy Changvar, Phnom Penh, Kingdom of Cambodia.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-9365","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry","post-no-thumbnail"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/9365","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/2"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=9365"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/9365\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":37030,"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/936